stable curated slug (see the internal \code{hr_stage_map()}); anything else is
auto-slugged from the heading (Croatian diacritics transliterated to ASCII,
lowercased, non-alphanumerics collapsed to underscores). Each stage becomes
an \verb{attachment_urls_<slug>} / \verb{local_path_<slug>} list-column; the
deduplicated union goes into \code{attachment_urls} / \code{local_path} (required by
